WEBVTT

01:35:53.375 --> 01:35:54.709
Surya, my boy!

01:35:55.084 --> 01:35:57.417
Sir, I found the Chief Guest
for our 25th anniversary.

01:35:57.584 --> 01:35:58.542
You did?

01:35:58.792 --> 01:35:59.667
Who's that?

01:35:59.834 --> 01:36:00.709
25th Anniversary?

01:36:00.792 --> 01:36:01.667
THURSDAY

01:36:01.917 --> 01:36:03.542
-Nice card.
-I designed it, sir.

01:36:03.625 --> 01:36:05.209
But I can't make it.
I'm going to Delhi.

01:36:05.334 --> 01:36:07.167
Sir, he'll explain
the agenda in two minutes.

01:36:07.292 --> 01:36:09.667
I'm going to the temple.
I'll see you in the evening.

01:36:09.792 --> 01:36:11.375
-He's going to the temple.
-He's saying evening.
